```

### exercise_body_part group by exercise_id
```sql
select ebp.exercise_id, count(ebp.body_part_id)
  , e.name as exercise_name
  , group_concat(bp.part) as body_parts
  , m.name as machine_name
  from exercise_body_part ebp
    left join body_part bp on ebp.body_part_id = bp.id
    left join exercise e on ebp.exercise_id = e.id
    left join machine m on e.machine_id = m.id
  group by exercise_id
  having count(body_part_id) > 1;
```

